{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1438833-wealth-resources-at-origins-level","id":1438833,"title":"Wealth & resources at Origins level","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-09T15:59:35-08:00","id":1438833,"title":"Wealth & resources at Origins level","content":"I've been looking over Origins carefully. I'm not seeing anything regarding wealth &amp; resources, other than potential background path 'Life of Privilege', but nothing specific. I'm having a player thinking of someone who is a investor/board member of a company during part of their origin. As we are dealing in myth, I tend to hand wave such concerns within reason, but is there anything as a gauge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T16:07:50-08:00","id":1438834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheWanderingJewels</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1438833-wealth-resources-at-origins-level#post1438833\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been looking over Origins carefully. I'm not seeing anything regarding wealth &amp; resources, other than potential background path 'Life of Privilege', but nothing specific. I'm having a player thinking of someone who is a investor/board member of a company during part of their origin. As we are dealing in myth, I tend to hand wave such concerns within reason, but is there anything as a gauge?</div> </div> </div> </div>Characters have whatever mundane resources are justified by their Paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T01:39:28-08:00","id":1438908,"title":"","content":"One of my players have chosen <i>Life of Privilege</i> as Origin Path and <i>CEO Scientist</i> as Role. He is basically mythical version of Tony Stark now, paying any costs the Band have - and even providing them their own jet for travel.<b> Sidenote: </b>Character is also said to work similar as Jeff Bezos, like AI, new technologies, etc. He even sold prototype of his AI Assistants system - Alexandria - to Amazon that changed few things... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_Alexa\" target=\"_blank\">Alexa</a>, any one? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> Character is Incarnation of <i>Kuros of Teros</i>, <i>Messenger of Winged Throne</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( See <b>Scion </b>2E <b>Companion - Mysteries of the World</b>, for god's write-up. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-10-2021, 04:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T17:00:52-08:00","id":1439066,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, your resources are now part of your paths. So your board member could have all the superficial markers of wealth by taking the path &quot;Investment Banker.&quot; If he wants to know someone or have access to something outside the norm, that works be &quot;invoking the path,&quot; which would be governed by the paths system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24383-laughinggull","name":"LaughingGull","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24383_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}